      "excerpt_sha256": "2ee1a5e99a12169fa635e48c6b3e40d28ee96247f28af68410823015fb4348b5",
      "excerpt_text": "Vitamin A is available in stand-alone supplements and most multivitamins, often in the form of retinyl acetate, retinyl palmitate, provitamin A beta-carotene, or a combination.",
