      "excerpt_text": "A PubMed abstract reports an in vitro digestion study comparing calcium carbonate, calcium citrate malate, calcium phosphate, and calcium bisglycinate; final calcium bioaccessibility differed by source (about 20-36%).",
      "source": "PubMed",
      "url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29287395/"
