      "excerpt_sha256": "9bd17bb273beafff3ab1a41030eb852b7774fe47c16123b6da059adffff7c52a",
      "excerpt_text": "Other forms include manganese gluconate, manganese picolinate, manganese sulfate, manganese citrate, and manganese chloride. No data are available on the relative bioavailability of different forms of supplemental manganese.",
