      "excerpt_sha256": "c09a0180c3a74f4a5b1777db5127aafbc96935e65ecf2f6f2a534f83aa9b6315",
      "excerpt_text": "Twenty-four barrows were randomly allotted to diets that consisted of cellulose and either zinc sulphate (C) or zinc glycinate (ZnGly).",
