      "excerpt_sha256": "9541baf9e43b0e3613790566dd5c406062c0a9da2a54b61d927c49f603b9af56",
      "excerpt_text": "Naturally occurring vitamin E exists in eight chemical forms (alpha-, beta-, gamma-, and delta-tocopherol and alpha-, beta-, gamma-, and delta-tocotrienol). Alpha-tocopherol is the only form that is recognized to meet human requirements.",
