      "excerpt_sha256": "9c917d5049f666be102930039d57cbe07a5d87b57e8919828d7e887c3e86cf2b",
      "excerpt_text": "A review on CoQ10 bioavailability reports that some studies found higher Cmax/AUC with ubiquinol versus ubiquinone, particularly in older subjects, but also cautions that comparisons can be confounded by formulation differences; it summarizes that the idea of universally superior ubiquinol bioavailability may be mistaken.",
